            </note>
            <note corresp="#d3-f2" n="2" xml:id="d3-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="frus1969-76v02#d242">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations,</hi> 1969–1976, vol. II,
                        Organization and Management of U.S. Foreign Policy, 1969–1972, Document
                        242</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d3-f3" n="3" xml:id="d3-f3-content">
                <p>The Ad Hoc Committee’s report and accompanying attachments are attached but not
                    printed. The report was forwarded by Andrew Marshall of the NSC Staff to
                    Kissinger under a June 21 covering memorandum. See <ref target="#d8-f2">footnote
                        2, Document 8</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
